-1.  **Boundary Check:** If the query point $\mathbf{p}$ has integer coordinates outside the volume bounds $[0, X_{DIM}-1] \times [0, Y_{DIM}-1] \times [0, Z_{DIM}-1]$, return $(0, 0, 0, 0)$ [S1, unofficial].
-2.  **Interpolation:**
